{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to have a happy and fun time, please come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to feel depressed, please play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aOverview\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genre: Psychological thriller, horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aStory\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A self-proclaimed victim and someone called the perpetrator by the self-proclaimed victim will appear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will listen to the conversation between the two and decide whether it is okay for the victim to take revenge on the perpetrator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> However, please do so carefully. Revenge in this case means &quot;the murder of the perpetrator by the victim.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aGame System\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a short horror novel game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can listen to conversations between characters,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or characters will talk to you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">so choose your opinion from the options and proceed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 8 rooms (stages) + 1 room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577000?t=1753113939","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577000/44d027fc7892f8a91ba12e5d6d39f5cd732c66ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753113939","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577000/d4399313945f4d4a6f82a35c80d9063a5ea53854/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753113939","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577000/d4399313945f4d4a6f82a35c80d9063a5ea53854/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753113939","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to have a happy and fun time, please come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to feel depressed, please play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aOverview\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genre: Psychological thriller, horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aStory\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A self-proclaimed victim and someone called the perpetrator by the self-proclaimed victim will appear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will listen to the conversation between the two and decide whether it is okay for the victim to take revenge on the perpetrator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> However, please do so carefully. Revenge in this case means &quot;the murder of the perpetrator by the victim.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aGame System\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a short horror novel game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can listen to conversations between characters,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or characters will talk to you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">so choose your opinion from the options and proceed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 8 rooms (stages) + 1 room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["IEOI"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577000/686db96f4703aa221ef0a4f7e26da3619ddc6805/header.jpg?t=1753113939","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117445,